# Locale Purity Guard

- Before deploy or git push, run `npm run check:i18n`.
- Keep locale files language-pure:
  - `public/locales/de/common.json` -> German only
  - `public/locales/en/common.json` -> English only
  - `public/locales/es/common.json` -> Spanish only
- If mixed terms are found, fix them before continuing.
- When changing copy in one locale, quickly scan sibling locales to avoid accidental carry-over.
